#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:204
msgid "Word-spacing"
msgstr "Razmik med besedami"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:207
msgid "x, y, dx, dy"
msgstr "x, y, dx, dy"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:209
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These are even finer-grained controls that can be used to position text. "
"However, they CANNOT be reliably converted to the format of the rich text "
"editor, because the rich text editor uses these to figure out if a line is a "
"new-line and thus writes to these."
msgstr ""
"To so še bolj zrnati kontrolniki, ki jih je mogoče uporabiti za določanje "
"položaja besedila. Vendar pa jih ni mogoče zanesljivo pretvoriti v obliko "
"urejevalnika obogatenega besedila, saj jih urejevalnik obogatenega besedila "
"uporablja za to, da ugotovi, ali je vrstica nova vrstica in tako piše na te."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:211
msgid "X and Y"
msgstr "X in Y"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:212
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"X and Y are absolute coordinates. But because you cannot change the absolute "
"coordinates of the text from the editor, these get added to the position "
"when they show up in a tspan."
msgstr ""
"X in Y sta absolutni koordinati. Ker pa iz urejevalnika ne morete spremeniti "
"absolutnih koordinat besedila, se te dodajo v položaj, ko se prikažejo v "
"tspanu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:214
msgid "dx and dy"
msgstr "dx in dy"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:214
#, fuzzy
msgid "These are relative coordinates to the position of the previous letter."
msgstr "To so relativne koordinate glede na položaj prejšnje črke."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:217
msgid "Font-stretch and Small-caps"
msgstr "Raztegovanje pisav in pomanjšane velike črke"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:219
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These can also be stored and written to the rich text tab's internal format, "
"but they don't get used in the on screen text object."
msgstr ""
"Te lahko shranite in zapisate tudi v notranjo obliko zavihka z obogatenim "
"besedilom, vendar se ne uporabljajo v besedilnem predmetu na zaslonu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dominant Baseline, Alignment baseline, Font-size-adjust, Writing mode, Glyph-"
"orientation, rotate"
msgstr ""
"Prevladujoča izhodiščna vrednost, izhodišče poravnave, prilagajanje "
"velikosti pisave, način pisanja, usmerjenost v glife, vrtenje"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:224
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These are not stored in the rich text right now, and while they can be "
"written into the SVG text, the SVG text-shape doesn't do anything with them."
msgstr ""
"Te trenutno niso shranjene v obogatenem besedilu in čeprav jih je mogoče "
"vneti v besedilo SVG, oblika besedila SVG z njimi ne naredi ničesar."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/text.rst:226
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita generates ``font-size-adjust`` for the font when coming from rich "
"text, as this can help designers when they want to use the SVG source as a "
"basis for later adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Krita ustvari »velikost pisave- prilagoditev« za pisavo, ko prihaja iz "
"obogatenega besedila, saj lahko to pomaga oblikovalcem, ko želijo uporabiti "
"SVG vir kot osnovo za poznejše prilagoditve."
